<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Feast of All Souls </title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --text: #111827;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --accent: #7c3aed;
      --border: #f0f0f5;
      --code-bg: #f8fafc;
      --tip-bg: #f5f3ff;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;

      text-align:center;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      text-align:left ;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color:#374151; 
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* ========== Emoji Ordered Lists ========== */

    ol.emoji-list {
      list-style: none;
      counter-reset: emoji-counter;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    ol.emoji-list > li {
      counter-increment: emoji-counter;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 3.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    ol.emoji-list > li::before {
      content: attr(data-emoji) " " counter(emoji-counter);
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      min-width: 2.6rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Pure emoji (no number) */
    ol.emoji-only > li::before {
      content: attr(data-emoji);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
    }

    /* Nested lists stay normal */
    ol.emoji-list ol {
      list-style: decimal;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    ol.emoji-list ol li {
      padding-left: 0;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    ol.emoji-list ol li::before {
      content: none;
    }

    ol.emoji-list > li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .tip {
      background: var(--tip-bg);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    code {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #6d28d9;
    }

    pre {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      padding: 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>All Souls</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">November 2nd is when Catholics celebrate All Souls Day.  We believe the dead are not gone, and from November 1st to November 8, we offer prayers and sacrifices for them:  An offering to loosen the chains that bind the spirit to the failings of flesh, to speed their way through the fires of purgatory and into the gates of heaven. Here's a guide on to how to celebrate:  

      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Example 1 -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>  &#x1F56F;&#xFE0F;Feast of All Souls: Done November 2nd </h2>
      <ol class="emoji-list">
        <li data-emoji="&#x26EA;">Attend a church</li>
        <li data-emoji="&#x1F64F;">While at the church, pray the Apostle's Creed and one Our Father

	</li>
      </ol>
      <div class ="tip">
<p><strong>The steps listed above offer help to the souls in purgatory. To offer them the greatest possible help, complete these additional steps:</strong></p>

      </div>
      <ol class="emoji-list">
	<li data-emoji="&#x1F35E;">Receive the Eucharist</li>
        <li data-emoji="&#128682;">Go to confession 20 days before or after</li>
	<li data-emoji="&#x1F54A;&#xFE0F;">Say one Our Father and one Hail Mary for the intentions of the pope</li>
	<li data-emoji="&#x1F607;">Be free from attachment to sin</li>

      </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- Example 2 -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>&#x1F56F;&#xFE0F; Prayers for the Holy Souls: Done November 1–8</h2>
      <ol class="emoji-list">
        <li data-emoji="💡">Go to any cemetery </li>
        <li data-emoji="&#x1F607;">While there, pray for the dead</li>
      </ol>    
      <div class="tip">
<p><strong>The steps listed above offer help to the souls in purgatory. To offer them the greatest possible help, complete these additional steps:</strong></p>
      </div>
      <ol class="emoji-list">
	<li data-emoji="&#x1F35E;">Receive the Eucharist</li>
        <li data-emoji="&#128682;">Go to confession 20 days before or after</li>
	<li data-emoji="&#x1F54A;&#xFE0F;">Say one Our Father and one Hail Mary for the intentions of the pope</li>
	<li data-emoji="&#x1F607;">Be free from attachment to sin</li>

      </ol>
    </div>
        </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>

